  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Synaptic Nexus",
    "summary": "As each [battle round](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-battle-round) begins, you can pick a Synaptic Imperative from the list below; no Synaptic Imperative can be picked more than once per battle. Your army has it active, and it benefits each **TYRANIDS** unit of yours that is in your army's [Synapse Range](vsdata:ability/tyranids.synapse), for the rest of the battle round. The Synaptic Imperatives are:\n\n- **Synaptic Augmentation**: the unit's models get an [invulnerable save](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls) of 5+.\n- **Surging Vitality**: the unit gets +1 to its [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) and [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step).\n- **Goaded to Slaughter**: melee attacks by the unit's models get +1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls).",
